12D85A8326149AE9D7AFF528AE8130A\" href=\"mailto:Kimberlynn.Vocke@tidalhealth.org\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif; text-decoration:none\">@Kimberlynn Vocke</span></a> if there are any additional changes to the position descriptions, please let us know so we can make those updates before posting.</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">For the CT and Radiology Supervisor roles now designated as (II), I used those job descriptions already in place. I found a few minor differences in the Radiology description and aligned the wording with the CT description for consistency. Please let us know if these updates are acceptable.</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\"><a id=\"OWAAMBE2E4ECA0932498E879EE9ECFC1185B7\" href=\"mailto:Nyeida.Aryee@tidalhealth.org\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif; text-decoration:none\">@Nyeida Aryee</span></a> please let Kimberlynn know next steps for the position in terms of posting and filling.</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" id=\"{00000001-47C5-29CC-0000-000100000000}\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">Please let us know if there are any questions, we are happy to help.&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\">&nbsp;</p><table class=\"MsoNormalTable\" border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" id=\"{00000003-1606-2DBD-0000-000100000000}\" style=\"border-collapse:collapse\"><tbody><tr id=\"{00000004-1606-2DBD-0000-000100000000}\"><td width=\"155\" valign=\"top\" id=\"{00000005-0617-33C0-0000-000100000000}\" style=\"width:116.6pt; border:solid windowtext 1.0pt; padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\" id=\"{00000001-695B-E96F-0000-000100000000}\"><b><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">Title:</span></b></p></td><td width=\"396\" valign=\"top\" id=\"{00000005-4328-F9DB-0000-000100000000}\" style=\"width:297.0pt; border:solid window