"{00000004-1818-601D-0000-000100000000}\"><td width=\"155\" valign=\"top\" id=\"{00000005-4F0B-CBB3-0000-000100000000}\" style=\"width:116.6pt; border:solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-top:none; padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\" id=\"{00000001-4F0B-CBB3-0000-000100000000}\"><b><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">FTE Leader:</span></b></p></td><td width=\"396\" valign=\"top\" id=\"{00000005-1292-7828-0000-000100000000}\" style=\"width:297.0pt; border-top:none; border-left:none; border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right:solid windowtext 1.0pt; padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\" id=\"{00000001-1292-7828-0000-000100000000}\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">Y</span></p></td></tr><tr id=\"{00000004-2D0E-A975-0000-000100000000}\"><td width=\"155\" valign=\"top\" id=\"{00000005-7A2B-FA3E-0000-000100000000}\" style=\"width:116.6pt; border:solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-top:none; padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\" id=\"{00000001-7A2B-FA3E-0000-000100000000}\"><b><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">FTE Hours:</span></b></p></td><td width=\"396\" valign=\"top\" id=\"{00000005-042C-2832-0000-000100000000}\" style=\"width:297.0pt; border-top:none; border-left:none; border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right:solid windowtext 1.0pt; padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\" id=\"{00000001-042C-2832-0000-000100000000}\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">1.00</span></p></td></tr><tr id=\"{00000004-2247-5002-0000-000100000000}\"><td width=\"155\" valign=\"top\" id=\"{00000005-2687-B630-0000-000100000000}\" style=\"width:116.6pt; border:solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-top:none; padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\" id=\"{00000001-2687-B630-0000-000100000000}\"><b><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">Reports to:</span></b></p></td><td width=\"396\" valign=\"top\" id=\"{00000005-3F65-0A42-0000-000100000000}\" style=\"width:297.0pt; border-top:none; border-left:none; border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right:solid windowtext 1.0pt; padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\" id=\"{00000001-3F65-0A42-0000-000100000000}\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">Medical Imaging Director</span></p></td></tr><tr id=\"{00000004-51CA-47E6-0000-000100000000}\"><td width=\"155\" valign=\"top\" id=\"{00000005-24D5-21E3-0000-000100000000}\" style=\"width:116.6pt; border:solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-top:none; padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\" id=\"{00000001-24D5-21E3-0000-000100000000}\"><b><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">Job Description Status:</span></b></p></td><td width=\"396\" valign=\"top\" id=\"{00000005-1F81-CE0B-0000-000100000000}\" style=\"width:297.0pt; border-top:none; border-left:none; border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right:solid windowtext 1.0pt; padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\" id=\"{00000001-1F81-CE0B-0000-000100000000}\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">In progress, information for posting is below</span></p></td></tr></tbody></table><p class=\"MsoNormal\" id=\"{00000001-5835-1C78-0000-000100000000}\"><b><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">&nbsp;</span></b></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">Position Summary:</span></b></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" id=\"{00000001-27A2-9E44-0000-000100000000}\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">The CT Supervisor is responsible for overseeing the day -to-day operations of the Cat Scan department. They are responsible for ensuring the efficient and safe delivery of high-quality service to patients while also providing leadership and guidance to a team of CT Technologists.</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" id=\"{00000001-249E-599E-0000-000100000000}\"><b><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">&nbsp;</span></b></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">Education:</span></b></p><ul type=\"disc\" id=\"{00000006-51FB-8AA0-0000-010000000000}\" style=\"margin-top:0in\"><li class=\"MsoListParagraph\" id=\"{00000001-51FB-8AA0-0000-000100000000}\" style=\"margin-left:0in\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">Graduate of an accredited school of Radiology required. </span></li><li class=\"MsoListParagraph\" id=\"{00000001-3A02-0E2B-0000-000100000000}\" style=\"margin-left:0in\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">Bachelor's degree from an accredited college in a related field of study preferred. </span></li></ul><p class=\"MsoNormal\" id=\"{00000001-3794-AE6B-0000-000100000000}\"><b><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">&nbsp;</span></b></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">License and/or certification:</span></b></p><ul type=\"disc\" id=\"{00000006-1740-290A-0000-010000000000}\" style=\"margin-top:0in\"><li class=\"MsoNormal\" id=\"{00000001-1740-290A-0000-000100000000}\" style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">Must be a registered CT Technologist with the ARRT.</span></li><li class=\"MsoNormal\" id=\"{00000001-74B3-1A56-0000-000100000000}\" style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">Must obtain a license from the Maryland Board of Physicians Quality Assurance to practice as a CT Technologist in the state of Maryland. </span></li></ul><p class=\"MsoNormal\" id=\"{00000001-1606-3BBF-0000-000100000000}\"><b><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">&nbsp;</span></b></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">Experience:</span></b></p><ul type=\"disc\" id=\"{00000006-6C71-22A2-0000-010000000000}\" style=\"margin-top:0in\"><li class=\"MsoNormal\" id=\"{00000001-6C71-22A2-0000-000100000000}\" style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">Minimum of five (5) years as a CT Technologist.</span></li><li class=\"MsoNormal\" id=\"{00000001-7348-843F-0000-000100000000}\" style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">Three (3) years of progressively responsible and directly related work experience, including one (1) year of work-lead or supervisory experience. </span></li></ul><p class=\"MsoNormal\" id=\"{00000001-4B4A-8B66-0000-000100000000}\"><b><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">&nbsp;</span></b></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">Schedule:</span></b></p><ul type=\"disc\" id=\"{00000006-7E4E-8C34-0000-010000000000}\" style=\"margin-top:0in\"><li class=\"MsoNormal\" id=\"{00000001-7E4E-8C34-0000-000100000000}\" style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt; line-height:115%\">Primarily day shift, Monday through Friday.</span></li><li class=\"MsoNormal\" id=\"{00000001-2665-9A0F-0000-000100000000}\" style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt; line-height:115%\">Occasional weekends, evenings or holidays as needed. </span></li><li class=\"MsoNormal\" id=\"{00000001-5FD6-B235-0000-000100000000}\" style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt; line-height:115%\">On-call rotation evenings and weekends as needed.</span></li></ul><p class=\"MsoNormal\" id=\"{00000001-22D3-EBF8-0000-000100000000}\"><img border=\"0\" width=\"1241\" height=\"5\" id=\"_x0000_i1035\" src=\"cid:image002.png@01DD6613.9CE666E0\" style=\"width:12.925in; height:.05in\"></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" id=\"{00000001-1545-AB4E-0000-000100000000}\"><span style=\"z-index:251659264; margin-top:288px; width:1574px; height:5px\"><img width=\"1259\" height=\"4\" src=\"cid:image004.png@01DD6613.9CE666E0\" style=\"width:13.1166in; height:.0416in\"></span><br clear=\"all\"></p><table class=\"MsoNormalTable\" border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" id=\"{00000003-74BE-29D4-0000-000100000000}\" style=\"border-collapse:collapse\"><tbody><tr id=\"{00000004-74BE-29D4-0000-000100000000}\"><td width=\"155\" valign=\"top\" id=\"{00000005-5BFF-6B9B-0000-000100000000}\" style=\"width:116.6pt; border:solid windowtext 1.0pt; padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\" id=\"{00000001-5BFF-6B9B-0000-000100000000}\"><b><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">Title:</span></b></p></td><td width=\"396\" valign=\"top\" id=\"{00000005-70CF-F385-0000-000100000000}\" style=\"width:297.0pt; border:solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-left:none; padding:0in 5