00}\"><td width=\"155\" valign=\"top\" id=\"{00000005-7619-4FEC-0000-000100000000}\" style=\"width:116.6pt; border:solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-top:none; padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\" id=\"{00000001-7619-4FEC-0000-000100000000}\"><b><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">FTE Leader:</span></b></p></td><td width=\"396\" valign=\"top\" id=\"{00000005-441B-FEE1-0000-000100000000}\" style=\"width:297.0pt; border-top:none; border-left:none; border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right:solid windowtext 1.0pt; padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\" id=\"{00000001-441B-FEE1-0000-000100000000}\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">Y</span></p></td></tr><tr id=\"{00000004-653C-9E9D-0000-000100000000}\"><td width=\"155\" valign=\"top\" id=\"{00000005-0B2B-1968-0000-000100000000}\" style=\"width:116.6pt; border:solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-top:none; padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\" id=\"{00000001-0B2B-1968-0000-000100000000}\"><b><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">FTE Hours:</span></b></p></td><td width=\"396\" valign=\"top\" id=\"{00000005-0F7A-6335-0000-000100000000}\" style=\"width:297.0pt; border-top:none; border-left:none; border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right:solid windowtext 1.0pt; padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\" id=\"{00000001-0F7A-6335-0000-000100000000}\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">1.00</span></p></td></tr><tr id=\"{00000004-0822-DE00-0000-000100000000}\"><td width=\"155\" valign=\"top\" id=\"{00000005-619D-D1A0-0000-000100000000}\" style=\"width:116.6pt; border:solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-top:none; padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\" id=\"{00000001-619D-D1A0-0000-000100000000}\"><b><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">Reports to:</span></b></p></td><td width=\"396\" valign=\"top\" id=\"{00000005-7E7F-CE86-0000-000100000000}\" style=\"width:297.0pt; border-top:none; border-left:none; border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right:solid windowtext 1.0pt; padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\" id=\"{00000001-7E7F-CE86-0000-000100000000}\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">Medical Imaging Director</span></p></td></tr><tr id=\"{00000004-2DA2-E908-0000-000100000000}\"><td width=\"155\" valign=\"top\" id=\"{00000005-3CAB-4818-0000-000100000000}\" style=\"width:116.6pt; border:solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-top:none; padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\" id=\"{00000001-3CAB-4818-0000-000100000000}\"><b><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">Job Description Status:</span></b></p></td><td width=\"396\" valign=\"top\" id=\"{00000005-11F9-8D00-0000-000100000000}\" style=\"width:297.0pt; border-top:none; border-left:none; border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right:solid windowtext 1.0pt; padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\" id=\"{00000001-11F9-8D00-0000-000100000000}\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">In progress, information for posting is below</span></p></td></tr></tbody></table><p class=\"MsoNormal\" id=\"{00000001-5DD2-9BF1-0000-000100000000}\"><b><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">&nbsp;</span></b></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">Position Summary:</span></b></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" id=\"{00000001-0BF2-C0A9-0000-000100000000}\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">The Radiology Supervisor supervises those functions directly involved with a variety of clinical and technical procedures applying ionizing radiation under the minimal direction of the Radiologists and Departmental Senior Director. This position supervises &amp; manages the Radiologic Technologists and provides staffing schedules. Provides oversite of Wor Wic Radiological Technology students while on site. Responsible for ordering all department supplies and insuring inventory of same. Coordinates &amp; supports the activities of Diagnostic Radiology with the other Medical Imaging divisions &amp; the other Departments (Surgical, Endoscopy and Emergency Services) to ensure proper patient flow and appropriateness of care provided.</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" id=\"{00000001-7AD5-C179-0000-000100000000}\"><b><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">&nbsp;</span></b></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">Education:</span></b></p><ul type=\"disc\" id=\"{00000006-5313-8CFC-0000-010000000000}\" style=\"margin-top:0in\"><li class=\"MsoListParagraph\" id=\"{00000001-5313-8CFC-0000-000100000000}\" style=\"margin-left:0in\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">Graduate of an accredited school of Radiology required. </span></li><li class=\"MsoListParagraph\" id=\"{00000001-3014-872D-0000-000100000000}\" style=\"margin-left:0in\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">Bachelor's degree from an accredited college in a related field of study preferred. </span></li></ul><p class=\"MsoNormal\" id=\"{00000001-1E92-84D8-0000-000100000000}\"><b><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">&nbsp;</span></b></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">License and/or certification:</span></b></p><ul type=\"disc\" id=\"{00000006-54DB-97D8-0000-010000000000}\" style=\"margin-top:0in\"><li class=\"MsoNormal\" id=\"{00000001-54DB-97D8-0000-000100000000}\" style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">Must be a registered with the ARRT.</span></li><li class=\"MsoNormal\" id=\"{00000001-075D-096C-0000-000100000000}\" style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">Must obtain a license from the Maryland Board of Physicians Quality Assurance to practice as a Radiologic Technologist in the state of Maryland. </span></li></ul><p class=\"MsoNormal\" id=\"{00000001-173F-2072-0000-000100000000}\"><b><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">&nbsp;</span></b></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">Experience:</span></b></p><ul type=\"disc\" id=\"{00000006-1CD7-F961-0000-010000000000}\" style=\"margin-top:0in\"><li class=\"MsoNormal\" id=\"{00000001-1CD7-F961-0000-000100000000}\" style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">Minimum of five (5) years as a Radiologic Technologist.</span></li><li class=\"MsoNormal\" id=\"{00000001-2486-CE7D-0000-000100000000}\" style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">Three (3) years of progressively responsible and directly related work experience, including one (1) year of work-lead or supervisory experience. </span></li></ul><p class=\"MsoNormal\" id=\"{00000001-62AC-597D-0000-000100000000}\"><b><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">&nbsp;</span></b></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">Schedule:</span></b></p><ul type=\"disc\" id=\"{00000006-47F2-FA09-0000-010000000000}\" style=\"margin-top:0in\"><li class=\"MsoNormal\" id=\"{00000001-47F2-FA09-0000-000100000000}\" style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt; line-height:115%\">Primarily day shift, Monday through Friday.</span></li><li class=\"MsoNormal\" id=\"{00000001-4F6F-13CB-0000-000100000000}\" style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt; line-height:115%\">Occasional weekends, evenings or holidays as needed. </span></li><li class=\"MsoNormal\" id=\"{00000001-7357-3B7E-0000-000100000000}\" style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt; line-height:115%\">On-call rotation evenings and weekends as needed.</span></li></ul><p class=\"MsoNormal\" id=\"{00000001-5A11-2669-0000-000100000000}\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">Thanks,</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" id=\"{00000001-7EEC-E1E5-0000-000100000000}\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">Erin Cowder, SHRM-CP</span></b></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">Compensation Analyst</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">Human Resources Department</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">Tidal Health</span></b></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b>tidalhealth.org</b></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"MsoNo